      "D-GOV2-3": "Protected trust-root authorization only for the minimal changes of WI-1..WI-7 plus trust-root reseal; anything broader needs a new Founder decision.",
      "D-GOV2-4": "automation/factory-supervisor.mjs (legacy product supervisor, Codex-only reviewer) is retired fail-closed (LEGACY_CODEX_REVIEW_PATH_RETIRED): never merges, never reviews, never auto-passes.",
